    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in, spread your wings, and ignite your jetpack\u2014<strong>Jet Birds</strong> is a high-speed, high-skill racing game where precision flying is the key to victory. Take control of a jet-powered bird and weave through breathtaking natural environments, balancing speed and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/79bf3743a89c1b8dc44b3c87184191a7.poster.avif?t=1755261323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/79bf3743a89c1b8dc44b3c87184191a7.webm?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/79bf3743a89c1b8dc44b3c87184191a7.mp4?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full control over <strong>pitch, yaw, </strong>and <strong>roll</strong>, plus the ability to <strong>adjust your wingspan</strong> on the fly, every turn and dive is in your hands.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Use your <strong>dodge</strong> and <strong>dash</strong>\u00a0abilities to avoid obstacles and dart through gaps as you<strong>\u00a0</strong>fine-tune your flight to shave milliseconds off your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/581f95caace675113ce7f5e48766de4e.poster.avif?t=1755261323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/581f95caace675113ce7f5e48766de4e.webm?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/581f95caace675113ce7f5e48766de4e.mp4?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against the Clock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in <strong>time trial races</strong>, pushing the limits of speed and precision to dominate the <strong>global</strong> <strong>leaderboards</strong>. Every second counts as you refine your route, optimize your aerodynamics, and perfect your jet-fueled maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/9a9fe163cfa0c4d6777c3ae93501accc.poster.avif?t=1755261323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/9a9fe163cfa0c4d6777c3ae93501accc.webm?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/9a9fe163cfa0c4d6777c3ae93501accc.mp4?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Bird, Choose Your World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through <strong>over 20 unique environments</strong>, from towering mountain peaks to dense jungle valleys, each offering a distinct challenge. Select from a diverse roster of <strong>jetpack-equipped birds</strong>, each with their own personality and flight characteristics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Precision Flight Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Full 3D movement with advanced controls for a true test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>High-Fidelity Physics</strong> \u2013 True-to-life aerodynamics where every adjustment affects your flight.<br>\u2705 <strong>Time Trial Racing</strong> \u2013 Compete against yourself and others to climb the leaderboards.<br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 Over 20 beautifully crafted natural landscapes to race through.<br>\u2705 <strong>Customized Birds</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of birds, each with unique designs and flight characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a speed-running pro or just looking for the thrill of high-velocity flight, <strong>Jet Birds</strong> will push your skills to the limit. The sky is yours\u2014<strong>fly fast!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap in, spread your wings, and ignite your jetpack\u2014<strong>Jet Birds</strong> is a high-speed, high-skill racing game where precision flying is the key to victory. Take control of a jet-powered bird and weave through breathtaking natural environments, balancing speed and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/79bf3743a89c1b8dc44b3c87184191a7.poster.avif?t=1755261323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/79bf3743a89c1b8dc44b3c87184191a7.webm?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/79bf3743a89c1b8dc44b3c87184191a7.mp4?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full control over <strong>pitch, yaw, </strong>and <strong>roll</strong>, plus the ability to <strong>adjust your wingspan</strong> on the fly, every turn and dive is in your hands.<strong>\u00a0</strong>Use your <strong>dodge</strong> and <strong>dash</strong>\u00a0abilities to avoid obstacles and dart through gaps as you<strong>\u00a0</strong>fine-tune your flight to shave milliseconds off your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/581f95caace675113ce7f5e48766de4e.poster.avif?t=1755261323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/581f95caace675113ce7f5e48766de4e.webm?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/581f95caace675113ce7f5e48766de4e.mp4?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Against the Clock</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in <strong>time trial races</strong>, pushing the limits of speed and precision to dominate the <strong>global</strong> <strong>leaderboards</strong>. Every second counts as you refine your route, optimize your aerodynamics, and perfect your jet-fueled maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/9a9fe163cfa0c4d6777c3ae93501accc.poster.avif?t=1755261323\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/9a9fe163cfa0c4d6777c3ae93501accc.webm?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534650/extras/9a9fe163cfa0c4d6777c3ae93501accc.mp4?t=1755261323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Bird, Choose Your World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through <strong>over 20 unique environments</strong>, from towering mountain peaks to dense jungle valleys, each offering a distinct challenge. Select from a diverse roster of <strong>jetpack-equipped birds</strong>, each with their own personality and flight characteristics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Precision Flight Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Full 3D movement with advanced controls for a true test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>High-Fidelity Physics</strong> \u2013 True-to-life aerodynamics where every adjustment affects your flight.<br>\u2705 <strong>Time Trial Racing</strong> \u2013 Compete against yourself and others to climb the leaderboards.<br>\u2705 <strong>Dynamic Environments</strong> \u2013 Over 20 beautifully crafted natural landscapes to race through.<br>\u2705 <strong>Customized Birds</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of birds, each with unique designs and flight characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a speed-running pro or just looking for the thrill of high-velocity flight, <strong>Jet Birds</strong> will push your skills to the limit. The sky is yours\u2014<strong>fly fast!</strong></p>",
